===Tips and equipment===
*The ideal inventory setup has just enough empty inventory slots to hold the required amount of sq'irk for making the juice, one pestle and mortar, optional potions/boosters and the remaining space as beer glasses.
*[[Beer glass]]es can be made using the [[Crafting]] skill or obtained by searching the [[Shelves (Sorceress's house)|shelves]] in the house that the [[apprentice]] and Aadeela the Sorceress are in.
*It is possible to get into the gardens by using [[Thieving]] [[Temporary skill boosts|boosts]], such as those from the juices themselves.
*The elementals can only 'see' and teleport the player when there are two or fewer squares between them and the player.

